# Compiled binaries. `seed` (a 13 MB macOS arm64 build of cmd/seed) was tracked
# at the repo root: it shipped a developer's local build to every clone, entered
# every Docker build context, and embedded the demo roster it seeds. The
# Dockerfile builds cmd/seed from source, so the binary never needed committing.
/seed
/saathi-server
/saathi-seed
*.exe
